cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use InciGraph, please cite both the code repository and the data deposit."
title: "InciGraph"
abstract: >-
  Open infrastructure for ordered, intersectional, multimorbidity
  incidence rates in UK primary care. Provides 45.2 million precomputed
  incidence-rate estimates across 63 long-term conditions, ordered
  trajectories of length 1-3, and 15 demographic stratification schemes,
  derived from CPRD Aurum data on 13.9 million patients.
type: software
